---
/** A line of the article set large, to give a long page a breath. It's part of the text, so it reads aloud as usual. */
---
<p class="pull"><slot /></p>

<style>
  .pull { margin: 2rem 0 2.25rem; padding: 0.2rem 0 0.2rem 1.4rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    font: italic 600 clamp(1.45rem, 3.4vw, 1.9rem)/1.25 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 30em; }
</style>
